<translate>
==== DisappearOnUse ==== <!--T:1-->

<!--T:2-->
If the parameter is set to false, then there will be no waste of using the item (In normal use).
<syntaxhighlight lang="Java">
DisappearOnUse = false,
</syntaxhighlight>
